<title>UK: Alitalia cargo fuel surcharge from Nov 15.</title>
<headline>Alitalia cargo fuel surcharge from Nov 15.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian national carrier, Alitalia is introducing a worldwide fuel surcharge of 160 lire per kg, or its equivalent in local currency, with effect from November 15, UK cargo manager, Paul Rodwell told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said he expected that for ex-UK cargo to Europe, Alitalia would follow British Airways Plc and apply a lower rate.</p>
<p>BA is applying a surcharge of six pence per kg on intercontinental routes and three pence a kg for European and UK domestic routes from November 8.</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
